  len1 (msg chunks): 4
  len2 (csum chunks):2
  len (total chains):6

Sizes:
  Public key: 96 bytes
  Signature:  96 bytes

Comparison (with n=32, w=16):
  Lamport signature: 8192 bytes
  WOTS+ signature:   2144 bytes (len=67)
  Reduction:         ~3.8x smaller

